\title{Dr. Derek Sorensen}
\author{dhsorens}

\p{
  I am a mathematician and computer scientist. My [PhD](dhsorens-phd) was in formal specification of smart contracts in Coq, focusing on the problem of ensuring that specifications actually reflect the high-level intentions of their designers. Formal proposition and proof catch my attention in computer science, from various angles. These days, I am mostly interested in [Lean](dhsorens-lean).
}

\p{Here you can see my [research](dhsorens-rsrch), [notes](dhsorens-notes), [work history](dhsorens-001C), and [bio](dhsorens).}

